The hallmark of Greennuts Sambar Masala lies in its meticulous selection of spices, each chosen for its ability to elevate the natural flavors of Sambar. The spice mix includes aromatic ingredients such as coriander seeds, cumin, fenugreek, mustard seeds, and dried chilies. These spices are carefully roasted and ground to create a balance that is both robust and harmonious.

