Health benefits associated with corn powder further underscore its value as a dietary staple. For individuals with gluten sensitivities or celiac disease, corn powder offers a gluten-free alternative, making it a safe and nutritious choice for those with dietary restrictions. Additionally, the high fiber content in corn powder aids in maintaining a healthy digestive system by promoting regular bowel movements and preventing constipation. The presence of antioxidants in corn powder also supports overall health by combating oxidative stress and reducing inflammation.

